Z||000013||pHoOl||01-27-2001||12:05 PM||||I had never thought of doing that, but that looks awesome.  Here's a question..... what do you have to do to change one to T-tops?  Is there frame reinforcement that needs to be done?  Cause if it's just as easy as swapping roofs, i just might have to look into it.  <P>Oh, another question, what all do you have to do to swap roofs?  I've heard of people doing it and saying it was easy, but i'm curious as to how reversable it would be.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
